==== hyperbricks yaml {!{api_fragment}} ====
api_fragment:
  - type: api_fragment_render
  - endpoint: https://api.example.com/rpc/logout
  - inline: <p>Logged out everywhere</p>
  - method: POST
  - route: auth-logout-all
  - setcookies:
      - token=; Path=/; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Max-Age=0
      - runtime_session=; Path=/; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Max-Age=0
==== explainer ====
Multiple Set-Cookie response templates
